Third-party components
----------------------

The evidence producer runs PARI/GP as a separate process. It does not link
against it: the two communicate through generated script files and standard
output. PARI/GP is distributed under the GNU General Public License and is
not included in this repository.

The full toolkit distribution, if you build one, does include PARI/GP
binaries. Distributing that archive carries the obligations of the GPL for
those binaries: keep the licence text alongside them and be able to supply
the corresponding source.

The verifier depends on num-bigint, num-integer, num-traits, sha1 and sha2,
each under the Apache-2.0 or MIT licence. The viewer is built with React
and Vite, under the MIT licence.
